Cell[TextData[{
 "At the density of 1/\[Pi], the ",
 StyleBox["skin",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " radius of 3.5 would have 12.25 particles within the ",
 StyleBox["skin",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ". Of course, there are only 12 or 13 particles, never a quarter particle.  \
On average though there will be 12.25, so when then average per particle \
increase is "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.945688674740331*^9, 3.9456888327318363`*^9}, {
  3.94568891338045*^9, 
